    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Penny Boulianne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112893423310557127635/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFibQrHmn9NFH172biQXyOTaAE97e9JF8Jma3WSIBXuoCv4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I recently leased a 2025 Venue at Hyundai lIe Perrot. I was very fortunate to have Gabriel Gagnon as my salesperson/advisor. Gabriel knows his products from a-z, listens to your needs and concerns with great attention to detail.I understand why Gabriel has won outstanding salesperson on his desk! The financing person Ralph Kabrita was just as knowledgable and professional in regards to all of my questions concerning the different types of financing and insurances available.9\nNot only did I have a car within two days, I also received a phone call as well as two follow up emails from Gabriel Gagnon.\nThe service at lle Perrot Hyundai is outstanding!\nThis team takes great care and pride in providing the very finest service!\nGo see Gabriel Gagnon and Ralph Kabrita you will not be disappointed!!!",
        "time": 1762803390,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Parisa G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118018417532548616678/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIHuafRuS6774eu6ipbNsrNQjmnq0PtjBRGlikHQitgzt7W0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "My daughter recently purchased a 2025 Hyundai Tucson in Pincourt, and we had an absolutely wonderful experience from beginning to end. The team at this dealership truly exceeded our expectations.\n\nI want to give a special thank you to Othman Chahir. He was incredibly honest, professional, and friendly. From the moment we met him, he made us feel comfortable and confident. He explained every detail clearly, answered all of our questions with patience, and never once made us feel pressured. His genuine approach and outstanding customer service really stood out. It is rare to meet someone so dedicated, trustworthy, and committed to making sure the customer is fully satisfied.\n\nI would also like to sincerely thank Ralph Kbrita from the finance department. He handled all the paperwork and financial arrangements smoothly and efficiently. Ralph made the whole process simple, transparent, and stress-free. He took the time to go over every detail, and his professionalism and kindness made a big difference.\n\nBoth Othman and Ralph were supportive, respectful, and truly cared about giving us the best experience. They worked as an amazing team, and because of them, my daughter felt happy and confident with her new car.\n\nOverall, the service was outstanding, and we are extremely pleased with everything. I highly recommend this dealership for anyone looking to buy a car. Thank you to the entire team for making this such a positive experience!",
        "time": 1764785004,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric Mann",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105867473479977408883/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJRz0YQbX74pcBi8IzU6tz7XBRR3YSQSti3ZeHwQwA19A1JDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I brought my 2015 Hyundai Elantra in with an engine knock code (P1326/P1327). The dealership charged $181.24 just to scan and report the code I had already observed and given to them. No physical inspection or verification of the engine was performed.\n\nThe invoice also included $11.68 for lubricant, anti-seize, and two degreasers, which were not meaningfully applied. I was then told I would need to pay an additional 4 hours at $181.24/hour tax incl. (~$725) just to determine whether the engine needed replacement.\n\nThis approach felt more like a financial gate than useful service. The total cost just to confirm the engine’s condition would have been over $900 with their pricing, with no guarantee of resolution.\n\nI cannot recommend this dealership for diagnosis based on my experience. The service provided did not reflect value for the cost, and there was no effort to properly diagnose or address the issue.",
        "time": 1767634080,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "John Westerman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115408827088243043959/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJW-K5adlFaSRCxDUJlgIiCMiW_lEjYSdADEYpU3SsherOmIA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Purchased an Elantra hybrid through Simon.  For what could have been a difficult transaction being based out of Ontario, Simon has made the decision and the entire process easier than if I went to a dealer in Ontario. Very happy with service received and would highly recommend to anyone looking to purchase at a great price with matching quality.",
        "time": 1742480974,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandria Ballesteros",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113872056424900545748/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVezivAo678_mdjYLrc_oDryYcKwohczMQ7pbeGasF2W1Z4vwD2fQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Pat Nadeau was super helpful for my first new car purchase, kept in touch throughout the financing and made sure everything was going well. Just as much Anne in financing was amazing and I could not have done it without her help, she really went above and beyond. Would definitely recommend going there for your next Hyundai !",
        "time": 1754433959,
        "translated": false
      }
